<!--
  The public pages of getconvocate.com, for search engines.

  Only pages a stranger can read without an account belong here: no /app, no
  /admin, no signing or registration links, no unsubscribe links.

  All ten /resources/<guide> pages are listed, free and paid alike, because
  every one of them is a real readable page: the two free guides are on their
  pages in full, and the eight paid guides open with real sections of the guide
  before the wall, so a crawler that never fills in a form still finds text worth
  indexing. The gate on a paid guide is a plan check, not a login — there is
  nothing here a crawler has to sign in to see. The two free guides carry
  priority 0.8 and the eight paid ones 0.5, which says what we would rather have
  found first without hiding the rest.

  /budget-calculator is listed at 0.9: it is the free public estimator, readable
  and usable by a stranger with no account and no form.

  The printable sheets (/print/guide/<guide>) are NOT listed: they are one-page
  copies behind an email form, and they are marked noindex.

  `lastmod` is deliberately absent rather than guessed: a date that is not the
  real date of the last change teaches crawlers to distrust the file.
-->
